{"4436840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Barbie™ Horse Ride & Rescue", "steam_appid": 4436840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Barbie “Brooklyn” Roberts and Barbie “Malibu” Roberts as volunteers at the Roaming Hearts Rescue Ranch. Explore a vibrant open world, scout for horses, and help solve the mystery of how they came to roam free in Moonrise Valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue Roaming Horses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/808dd1bca9802769a045d3248214cfdd.poster.avif?t=1786422805\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/808dd1bca9802769a045d3248214cfdd.webm?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/808dd1bca9802769a045d3248214cfdd.mp4?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride out on quests to rescue and befriend roaming horses and bring them home for rehabilitation. Discover thousands of combinations of beautiful horse coat colors and patterns to add to your stable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Loving Bond</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your rescued horses to earn their trust and settle them into their new home at the ranch. Form a bond with your horses and discover their unique personalities and traits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Part in Equestrian Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/251bfc491ee10657fc914f3cbf6b2c81.poster.avif?t=1786422805\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/251bfc491ee10657fc914f3cbf6b2c81.webm?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/251bfc491ee10657fc914f3cbf6b2c81.mp4?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the reins in challenges including barrel racing and time trial, then race the Moonrise Valley community in a friendly competition to improve your riding skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express Your Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/01e9fd366b5182b60e64797a2d5f47a2.poster.avif?t=1786422805\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/01e9fd366b5182b60e64797a2d5f47a2.webm?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/01e9fd366b5182b60e64797a2d5f47a2.mp4?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your avatar and horses to express your individual style! Collect hundreds of gorgeous tack sets and outfits to use in styling challenges and photo modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to saddle up for a cozy equestrian adventure in Barbie Horse Ride &amp; Rescue, coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Barbie “Brooklyn” Roberts and Barbie “Malibu” Roberts as volunteers at the Roaming Hearts Rescue Ranch. Explore a vibrant open world, scout for horses, and help solve the mystery of how they came to roam free in Moonrise Valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue Roaming Horses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/808dd1bca9802769a045d3248214cfdd.poster.avif?t=1786422805\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/808dd1bca9802769a045d3248214cfdd.webm?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/808dd1bca9802769a045d3248214cfdd.mp4?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride out on quests to rescue and befriend roaming horses and bring them home for rehabilitation. Discover thousands of combinations of beautiful horse coat colors and patterns to add to your stable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Loving Bond</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your rescued horses to earn their trust and settle them into their new home at the ranch. Form a bond with your horses and discover their unique personalities and traits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Part in Equestrian Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/251bfc491ee10657fc914f3cbf6b2c81.poster.avif?t=1786422805\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/251bfc491ee10657fc914f3cbf6b2c81.webm?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/251bfc491ee10657fc914f3cbf6b2c81.mp4?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the reins in challenges including barrel racing and time trial, then race the Moonrise Valley community in a friendly competition to improve your riding skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express Your Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/01e9fd366b5182b60e64797a2d5f47a2.poster.avif?t=1786422805\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/01e9fd366b5182b60e64797a2d5f47a2.webm?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/extras/01e9fd366b5182b60e64797a2d5f47a2.mp4?t=1786422805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dress up your avatar and horses to express your individual style! Collect hundreds of gorgeous tack sets and outfits to use in styling challenges and photo modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to saddle up for a cozy equestrian adventure in Barbie Horse Ride &amp; Rescue, coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Start your Western horse riding adventure with Barbie at Roaming Hearts Rescue Ranch. Rescue and rehabilitate charming horses, test your riding skills and customize your style as you uncover the mysteries of Moonrise Valley!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4436840/2db0b117c53ee3de69845d4e82cd55108e70dbbc/header.jpg?t=1786422805", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_